# XML formatting arrived in CSharpier 1.0 and is not what this repository adopted it for.
# Project files are reviewed as build configuration, not as prose, and reformatting them
# buries a one-line pin change in a whole-file diff.
*.csproj
*.props
*.targets
*.config
*.slnx

